 <section class="left-stack"><div class="panel card"><div class="eyebrow">A small beginning</div><div class="quest-title" id="questTitle">The Lantern Seed</div><p class="quest-desc" id="questDesc">Find Juniper near the old willow. A little kindness can wake the grove.</p><div class="quest-progress"><div class="progress-track"><div class="progress-fill" id="questFill"></div></div><span class="progress-text" id="questCount">0 / 3</span></div></div><div class="panel card"><div class="eyebrow">How the grove sees you</div><div class="rep-row"><span class="rep-name"><i class="rep-dot"></i>Grove kin</span><span class="rep-val" id="groveNum">52</span></div><div class="rep-track"><div class="rep-fill" id="groveBar"></div></div><div class="rep-row"><span class="rep-name"><i class="rep-dot lilac"></i>Starfall Academy</span><span class="rep-val" id="academyNum">38</span></div><div class="rep-track"><div class="rep-fill lilac" id="academyBar"></div></div></div><div class="panel neighbor-card"><div class="avatar" id="neighborAvatar">🦊</div><div class="neighbor-info"><div class="neighbor-name" id="neighborName">Juniper</div><div class="neighbor-role" id="neighborRole">Willow keeper · curious</div></div><div class="heart-line">♥ <span id="affinity">1</span></div></div></section><aside class="panel tip"><div class="tip-label">✦ A note from the grove</div><p id="tipText">Follow the pale stone path. Gather moonpetals, meet your neighbors, and make this place yours.</p></aside><div class="map-label">✦ Brackenroot Commons</div><div class="interact-prompt" id="prompt">E · Talk to Juniper</div><div class="toast" id="toast">A little magic found you.</div>
